# Oracle: VD cir-conditional (`@if`/`@elseif`/`@else`/`@end`; a branch holds instances, models
# and nested blocks only: a `parameters` there is refused, P2005). The bodies hold no instance:
# those are S4.1's area, and this fixture checks the chain, not an area's reading.
# codes: P2005 S0004
file "if_chain.sim" deck
  title "conditional blocks"
  param a = 1i
  param b = 0i
  if (a == 1i)
    comment " one"
  elif (b)
    if (b > 1i)
  else
    opaque vacask invalid "parameters c=1"
